== Usage ==
This template creates a green tower infobox. Fields are shown only when their parameters are supplied.

<pre>
{{Tower infobox
 | title = Example Tower
 | image = Example.png
 | location = District 1
 | previous_location = Old District
 | deconfirmed_from = Example Difficulty
 | tower_type = Tower
 | length = 10 floors
 | difficulty = Challenging
 | creator = Creator name
 | techniques = Wall hopping
 | previous_difficulty = Difficult
 | original_difficulty = Challenging
 | previous_name = Tower of Example
 | date_added = 1 January 2026
 | date_removed =
 | removal_reason =
}}
</pre>

Parameters:
* title — heading; defaults to the current page title.
* image — optional image filename.
* location, previous_location, deconfirmed_from, tower_type, length, difficulty, creator, techniques, previous_difficulty, original_difficulty, previous_name, date_added, date_removed, removal_reason — optional tower details.

This template uses the #if parser function, which requires the MediaWiki ParserFunctions extension. Preview it in a sandbox before using it on live pages.
</noinclude>